      "general": {
        "abstract": "The Nanjenshan Long-Term Ecological Site is a part of Kenting National Park. The site was classified as a tropical rain forest. It's a broad leaved evergreen forest. Monsoons are considered as a key driver that shape the distribution and ecology of forest ecosystems in Nanjenshan. ",
